# Upi QR Code Demo Websites

This repository demonstrates Upi QR Code generation across multiple frameworks and plain HTML. The implementation uses [upiqrcode.js](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/upiqrcode@1.5.5/upiqrcode.js) via CDN.

## React Demo
```jsx
import { useEffect } from 'react';

function App() {
  const [qrCode, setQrCode] = useState('');

  useEffect(() => {
    upiqrcode({
      payeeVPA: 'your-payee-vpa',
      amount: '100.00',
      currency: 'INR',
      transactionNote: 'Test transaction'
    }).then(qr => setQrCode(qr.qr));
  }, []);

  return (
    <div style={{ padding: '2rem' }}>
      <h1>React Upi QR Code</h1>
      <img src={`data:image/png;base64,${qrCode}`} alt="QR Code" />
    </div>
  );
}
```